Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.MOLBIOLCLINASSOC
Column name: GeneShort Type: TEXT Description: gene symbol(s), eg 'BCR/ABL1', or 'IGH+', etc
Column name: GeneLength Type: TEXT Description: length of gene string -- usually an integer between 0 and 15
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number, eg '15563'
Column name: Topo Type: TEXT Description: topography code, eg '0401'
Column name: KaryShort Type: TEXT Description: short or truncated karyotype string, eg 't(19;19)(p13;p13)' or '+12,+19'
Column name: MolClin Type: TEXT Description: this flag indicates whether this row describes a molecular 'M' or clinical 'C' association
Column name: KaryLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of karyotype description string (up to 569)
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number, usually between 1 and 10
Column name: Immunology Type: TEXT Description: immunology flag, usually blank, other values are 'B' or 'T'
Column name: Morph Type: TEXT Description: morphology code, eg '3111'
Column name: GeneLong Type: TEXT Description: this field is always blank (never needed)
Column name: KaryLong Type: TEXT Description: blank or long karyotype description
